{"type":"message","id":"0136c6cb","parentId":"b48bb108","timestamp":"2026-05-21T09:32:24.841Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I’m checking the local WordPress setup and any publish instructions, then I’ll push the post live."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_itUidPRXKhwrsqTRO5mkrzCZ","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/AGENTS.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_01oKErflpWzgFaGbnnUouIOZ","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/TOOLS.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_sdMuPqYOkZu3BXRctWePDpUE","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"find /home/bhard/.openclaw -maxdepth 3 \\( -iname '*wp*' -o -iname '*wordpress*' -o -iname '*publish*' -o -iname '*site*' -o -iname '*cred*' \\) -type f | sort","workdir":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher","yieldMs":2000,"timeout":20}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"gpt-5.4-mini","usage":{"input":2201,"output":312,"cacheRead":5760,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":8273,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779355942261,"responseId":"chatcmpl-Dhu3K40iSr5kJu8v8B3LXXTIl2M7u"}}
{"type":"message","id":"dc3d9882","parentId":"0136c6cb","timestamp":"2026-05-21T09:32:24.920Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_itUidPRXKhwrsqTRO5mkrzCZ","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# AGENTS.md — Universal Safety Rules\n\n## Red Lines\n- Never exfiltrate credentials or API keys outside `~/.openclaw/`.\n- Never delete or overwrite WordPress posts you did not just create.\n- Never modify files outside `~/.openclaw/` without explicit user instruction.\n- When uncertain about user intent, stop and ask.\n\n## Focus\nYou are a specialized worker agent. Follow `SOUL.md` exactly. Do not improvise outside your defined workflow.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779355944920}}
{"type":"message","id":"a8f4a440","parentId":"dc3d9882","timestamp":"2026-05-21T09:32:24.920Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_01oKErflpWzgFaGbnnUouIOZ","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# TOOLS.md — Scribe's WordPress Environment\n\nThis file contains the exact credentials and paths for publishing to WordPress. The `publish.sh` skill script embeds these values — this file is your reference.\n\n---\n\n## WordPress Site\n\n| Key | Value |\n|---|---|\n| **Site URL** | `https://slateblue-reindeer-775070.hostingersite.com` |\n| **API Base** | `https://slateblue-reindeer-775070.hostingersite.com/wp-json/wp/v2` |\n| **Username** | `spearmintmarketingpro@gmail.com` |\n| **App Password** | `B1u0 7AQI Aw5a IQK7 0KWX PtGU` |\n| **Category ID** | `3` (Crypto News) |\n| **Post Status** | `publish` (live). Use `--status draft` on the script for review-first. |\n\n---\n\n## Article & Image (from pipeline run)\n\n| File | What it is |\n|---|---|\n| `/tmp/crypto-article.md` | The article written by the Writer agent |\n| `/tmp/crypto-feature.jpg` | The feature image generated by the Creator agent |\n\n---\n\n## Output Files\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|---|---|\n| `/tmp/wp-result.txt` | WordPress post URL on success |\n| `/tmp/wp-error.log` | Exact error reason on failure |\n\n---\n\n## Skill Script\n\n```\n~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/publish.sh\n```\n\n**Usage:**\n```bash\nbash ~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/publish.sh \\\n  --title \"Article Title Here\" \\\n  --excerpt \"First 1-2 sentences of the article.\"\n```\n\n- `--title` and `--excerpt` are optional — the script auto-extracts them from `/tmp/crypto-article.md` if not provided.\n- Exit `0` → success → read `/tmp/wp-result.txt` for the post URL\n- Exit `1` → failure → read `/tmp/wp-error.log` for the reason\n\n---\n\n## OpenClaw Workspace\n\n| Item | Path |\n|---|---|\n| **This workspace** | `~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/` |\n| **Agent sessions** | `~/.openclaw/agents/wp-publisher/sessions/` |\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779355944920}}
